1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,831
Big changes start with small steps. Meet TrackVerse. Make room

2
00:00:04,831 --> 00:00:08,594
for better habits, and see your progress take shape.

3
00:00:10,417 --> 00:00:14,641
When routines live in scattered notes, it is easy to

4
00:00:14,641 --> 00:00:18,865
lose the thread. TrackVerse brings your habits, monthly plans, and

5
00:00:18,865 --> 00:00:20,977
focus time into one workspace.

6
00:00:22,783 --> 00:00:26,453
On the desktop welcome screen, choose Set up locally to

7
00:00:26,453 --> 00:00:30,123
begin without an account. Your data is saved on this

8
00:00:30,123 --> 00:00:33,792
device in SQLite. Google sign in is available for optional

9
00:00:33,792 --> 00:00:34,159
