31
00:01:58,117 --> 00:02:01,369
Press Start to begin. Pause when you need to, and

32
00:02:01,369 --> 00:02:04,622
resume when you are ready. Finish or reset to save

33
00:02:04,622 --> 00:02:07,875
elapsed work. Breaks and paused time are excluded. The timer

34
00:02:07,875 --> 00:02:10,477
