35
00:02:12,283 --> 00:02:15,741
Switch to the compact view to keep the floating timer

36
00:02:15,741 --> 00:02:19,198
above your other windows. Recorded work time appears in Focus

37
00:02:19,198 --> 00:02:22,656
Insights, grouped by habit, so you can see where your

38
00:02:22,656 --> 00:02:23,347
time went.

39
00:02:25,150 --> 00:02:29,089
In Settings, open Appearance and browse forty three themes. Every

40
00:02:29,089 --> 00:02:33,029
preset supports light and dark modes. Search for a palette,

41
00:02:33,029 --> 00:02:36,574
then choose the atmosphere that helps you settle in.

42
00:02:38,383 --> 00:02:42,401
Follow your system appearance, or choose light or dark manually.

43
00:02:42,401 --> 00:02:46,419
Typography controls let you choose a bundled font and adjust

44
00:02:46,419 --> 00:02:49,231
the overall text size for comfortable reading.

45
00:02:51,050 --> 00:02:55,074
In Data and privacy, choose Export backup to keep a

46
00:02:55,074 --> 00:02:59,097
portable JSON copy. Restore backup lets you bring a saved

47
00:02:59,097 --> 00:03:03,121
copy back. Optional Google Sheets backup is managed separately under

48
00:03:03,121 --> 00:03:04,730
Trackers and cloud backup.

49
00:03:06,550 --> 00:03:10,167
A clear plan. A daily check in. A little time

50
00:03:10,167 --> 00:03:13,783
